@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Offline : Shipper App Closed

Offline --> Available : loginShift()
Available --> AssignedToOrder : acceptDeliveryTask(orderId)
AssignedToOrder --> OnDelivery : confirmOrderPickup(orderId)\n[Order == ReadyForPickup]

OnDelivery --> CollectingCOD : arriveAtAddress() [paymentMethod == COD]
CollectingCOD --> CompletingHandover : confirmCashCollected(amount)\n/ cashOnHand += amount
OnDelivery --> CompletingHandover : arriveAtAddress() [paymentMethod == Online]

CompletingHandover --> Available : confirmDeliverySuccess()\n[Order -> Delivered]
OnDelivery --> Available : reportDeliveryFailure(reason)\n[Order -> DeliveryFailed]

Available --> SettlingCashAtHub : endShift() [cashOnHand > 0]
SettlingCashAtHub --> Offline : reconcileCashWithHub()\n/ cashOnHand = 0
Available --> Offline : endShift() [cashOnHand == 0]
@enduml